<title>USA: Childtime Learning buys seven centers.</title>
<headline>Childtime Learning buys seven centers.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Childtime Learning Centers Inc said Monday it had acquired seven Playcare Child Care centers in the Rochester, N.Y., area.</p>
<p>Childtime said it had also signed an operating agreement for two other Playcare centers.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Childtime said the acquisitions and agreements are part of its planned growth in specific markets over the next few years.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
